  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to EDM - Large Generation and Transmission Projects Phase IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance to EDM to support the development of key, large-scale generation and transmission projects in Mozambique, and to enhance sustainability in the utility through on-the job training and development of tools and templates. The objective of the project is to contribute to improved power generation and transmission, which will benefit both the domestic market and regional export of electricity, resulting in economic development. The long-term impact is sustainable management of Mozambique&#x2019;s energy resources and reliable and environmentally friendly power supply in the country and the region.</narrative>
  </description>
